label facts `gu3_remote_*`): the three local crossings are distinct on each side. -/
theorem w3a_y_ne : π.y_mp ≠ π.y_mq ∧ π.y_mp ≠ π.y_pq ∧ π.y_mq ≠ π.y_pq := by
